<span id="A13.T16.4.43.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">What are the years of birth of the players who have a lane agility time of more than 11.5 seconds, a three quarter sprint of less than 3.35 seconds, more than 10 field goals made and more than 8 rebounds in a game?</span>
</span></td></tr>
