<span id="A13.T16.4.47.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Which movies, starring Vincent D Onofrio as an actor, have an average rating greater than 5 and a median rating of 6, excluding ’Kolonya Cumhuriyeti’?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A13.T16.4.48" class="ltx_tr">
