<span id="A13.T16.4.51.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Who are the top 5 centers drafted in the 1st round, who have won the dpoy award after 2000, and who have earned more than 2 million dollars in the 2004-05 season, sorted by their draft year in descending order and birth year in ascending order?</span>
</span></td></tr>
