<span id="A13.T16.4.67.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">How many movies starring John Abraham have a median rating above 5 and average rating above 4?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A13.T16.4.68" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A13.T16.4.68.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A13.T16.4.68.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:47.7pt;">
<span id="A13.T16.4.68.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A13.T16.4.68.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SQL</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A13.T16.4.68.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A13.T16.4.68.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:337.9pt;">
<span id="A13.T16.4.68.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A13.T16.4.68.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SELECT COUNT(title) AS number_of_movies FROM movie WHERE title IN (SELECT movie_title FROM role_mapping WHERE category = ’actor’ AND name = ’John Abraham’ GROUP BY movie_title) AND title IN (SELECT movie_title FROM ratings WHERE median_rating &gt; 5 AND avg_rating &gt; 4)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
