<span id="A14.pic7.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A14.pic7.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Return the results in a FLAT JSON format. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A14.pic7.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DO NOT</span> include any explanations or notes in the output. <span id="A14.pic7.2.5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ONLY</span> return JSON.</span></span>
